ghostab (3.0.0-alpha) unstable; urgency=medium

  * RightDao replaces Startpage as the default search engine.
  * Browser-style keyboard shortcuts, closed-tab reopening.
  * Lists, tables, preformatted blocks, inline emphasis, definition lists,
    and an expanded set of HTML entities.
  * Emoji-aware text shaping with correct Unicode display widths.
  * Loading indicator, realistic request headers, and a persistent cookie jar.

